herobrinemod.jei.shrine=Totem shrine
herobrinemod.jei.shrine.side=Side view (fire on top)
herobrinemod.jei.shrine.desc=From the bottom: two gold blocks, the Herobrine Totem, netherrack; then light the netherrack on fire. Lightning strikes: "You don't know what you did...." - Herobrine is released and his creatures start to appear.\nBreak the totem or the shrine to bind him again.\nTotem recipe: 8 bones around soul sand.
herobrinemod.jei.HDummy.desc=Natural spawn. Once Herobrine is released it turns into a Stalker or a Builder (sometimes with a ghost, Chuck Norris, Pigbrine, Cowbrine or an evil chicken).
herobrinemod.jei.HerobrineStalker.desc=Appears next to you (sometimes pulls you to him), stares, freezes you, plays a random prank (fire ring, lightning, zombies, lava, potion, boss...) and vanishes.
herobrinemod.jei.HerobrineBuilder.desc=Wanders around and builds: pyramids, towers, tunnels, traps, signs, glass and redstone trails, cut leaves, TNT and fire.
herobrinemod.jei.Herobrine.desc=Fighting Herobrine: stares for 2 seconds, then attacks (8 damage). Sometimes his brother Notch shows up.
herobrinemod.jei.HGhost.desc=Flies like a ghast and shoots fireballs (Easy difficulty only).
herobrinemod.jei.HerobrineBoss.desc=Boss: flies, shoots wither skulls, breaks blocks, has a boss bar.
herobrinemod.jei.Notch.desc=Hunts every fighting Herobrine within 100 blocks (10 damage) and leaves in smoke when none remain.
herobrinemod.jei.ChuckNorris.desc=Appears, stares, roundhouse-kicks you and vanishes. Vanishes when hit.
herobrinemod.jei.HerobrineSlave.desc=Villager infected by Herobrine: hunts the nearest player and falls apart after about a minute.
herobrinemod.jei.Herobrinezombie.desc=Herobrine's fire-proof zombie servant.
herobrinemod.jei.Evilchicken.desc=Chicken-shaped spider that leaps at players day and night.
herobrinemod.jei.Cowbrine.desc=A cow that never stops staring at you and leaves lava where it dies.
herobrinemod.jei.Pigbrine.desc=Hostile pig that leaves primed TNT when it dies.
herobrinemod.jei.Jetra.desc=A sad, chatty guy (spawn egg only).
